WEBVTT

00:12:30.496 --> 00:12:33.373
Because if it's true

00:12:33.373 --> 00:12:36.502
that regardless of what you struggle with,

00:12:36.543 --> 00:12:39.880
you are worthy of a functional space,

00:12:42.216 --> 00:12:44.176
what else might you be worthy of?

00:12:45.469 --> 00:12:46.678
Thank you.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:53.519
(Applause and cheers)